{"diagnosis": "Loopback sent 0xa5 with divider 64 but RX got 0xff (idle) want 0xa5 per TRAP. TX ser_tx stayed at 1 from send_pattern ~0 during dummy burst because send_dummy && !send_bitcnt loads send_bitcnt <=15, and reg_div_we re-arms send_dummy, causing ~2x975-cycle idle that exceeds CYCLES=2024 so data never arrives. Root cause is oversized dummy count in excerpt at send_bitcnt load (refs picosoc/simpleuart.v:20, picosoc/picosoc.v:190 instance).",
 "patch_diff": "diff --git a/picosoc/simpleuart.v b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
--- a/picosoc/simpleuart.v
+++ b/picosoc/simpleuart.v
@@ -119,7 +119,7 @@
 			if (send_dummy && !send_bitcnt) begin
 				send_pattern <= ~0;
-				send_bitcnt <= 15;
+				send_bitcnt <= 1;
 				send_divcnt <= 0;
 				send_dummy <= 0;
 			end else
",
 "expected": "tohost PASS, TRAP gone, uart loopback got 0xa5 want 0

